Mr. Palma
Subject: Brokers Opinion of Pricing

I am writing this Brokers Opinion of Pricing for the land and real estate located at 3421 Gregg Way
in Cheyenne WY (Property).  I researched the property’s specific parcel information using the
Laramie County Parcel Mapping System.

I determined the site size of the property is 1.23 acres or 53,579 square feet. It is located near the
intersection of Ridge Rd. and Dell Range Blvd. within the King Soopers Shopping Center. The
parcel is zoned CB (commercial).

In arriving at a pricing for this property I will be using the market approach to determine pricing for
the commercial land.

**Please be advised that I am not a licensed appraiser and my opinion of value is based upon
my research, my visual inspection of the property and my expertise as a local Commercial
Real Estate Professional.

 THE MARKET APPROACH TO PRICING (Land)

The market approach to pricing determines pricing by comparing the subject property to
comparable properties which have sold recently as well as properties currently on the market.

In order to find comparable properties I searched the Cheyenne Multi-Listing System (MLS) for
similar properties that have sold within the past four years.  From my search I was able to locate
five similar properties that have sold in the Area.  Below you will find a table summarizing these
properties; I have also attached Their MLS information.

