Property Value = Price/Square Foot * Total Square Feet

Property Value = 13.01 * 53,579 = 697,062.79

Therefore, using the Market Approach to value, it is my opinion that the subject property pricing is
approximately $697,062.79.

Based on the easement size of 2,561 square feet the value would be:

2,561 SF X $13.01 SF = $33,318.61 Easement Land Value

Please be advised that I am not a licensed appraiser and my opinion of value is based upon my
research, my visual inspection of the property and my expertise as a local Commercial Real Estate
Professional.

